msgid "Double Youpï Refined Media Library"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: doubleyoupi-refined-media-library.php
msgid "https://doubleyoupi.com/plugins/refined-media-library"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: doubleyoupi-refined-media-library.php
msgid ""
"Nested folders with drag-and-drop, collections, duplicate and orphan "
"cleanup, auto alt text and WebP/AVIF for the WordPress media library, "
"without the per-image fiddling."
msgstr ""
"Cartelle nidificate con trascinamento, collezioni, pulizia di duplicati e "
"file orfani, testo alternativo automatico e WebP/AVIF per la libreria media "
"di WordPress, senza impostazioni immagine per immagine."

#. Author of the plugin
#: doubleyoupi-refined-media-library.php src/Admin/DyShell.php:118
#: src/Admin/OverviewPage.php:357
msgid "Double Youpï"
msgstr "Double Youpï"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: doubleyoupi-refined-media-library.php
msgid "https://doubleyoupi.com"
msgstr "https://doubleyoupi.com"

#: doubleyoupi-refined-media-library.php:58
msgid ""
"You are already running the full Double Youpï suite, and it includes Double "
"Youpï Refined Media Library. This standalone copy stepped aside to stay out "
"of its way. Want to run it on its own? Deactivate the suite first."
msgstr ""
"Stai già usando la suite completa Double Youpï, che include Double Youpï "
"Refined Media Library. Questa versione autonoma si è quindi fatta da parte "
"per non intralciare. Preferisci usarla da sola? Disattiva prima la suite."

# Retrait devant Refined Admin Dashboard, qui embarque la médiathèque.
#: doubleyoupi-refined-media-library.php:59
msgid ""
"Double Youpï Refined Admin Dashboard is active, and it includes this whole "
"media library: folders, collections and the detail panel. This copy stepped "
"aside. Your folders, collections and settings are untouched, and the "
"dashboard is using them right now. Want the media library on its own? "
"Deactivate Refined Admin Dashboard first."
msgstr ""
"Double Youpï Refined Admin Dashboard è attivo e include tutta questa "
"libreria multimediale: cartelle, raccolte e pannello dei dettagli. Questa "
"copia si è fatta da parte. Le tue cartelle, le tue raccolte e le tue "
"impostazioni sono intatte, e la bacheca le sta usando proprio ora. Vuoi la "
"libreria multimediale da sola? Disattiva prima Refined Admin Dashboard."

